  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Pick your model with its activity (changeable after a rest); the model weapons use Intelligence for attack and damage. <strong>Dreadnaught:</strong> Force Demolisher (reach 10 ft, 1d10 Force; the module offers to push or pull a smaller creature 10 ft) and Giant Stature (Bonus Action, Large for 1 minute, INT uses per Long Rest; +5 ft reach by hand). <strong>Guardian:</strong> Thunder Pulse (1d8 Thunder; the target has Disadvantage on attacks against anyone but you until your next turn) and Defensive Field (Bonus Action while Bloodied, temp HP = Artificer level). <strong>Infiltrator:</strong> Lightning Launcher (90/300 ft, 1d6 Lightning, +1d6 once per turn), Powered Steps (+5 ft Speed) and Dampening Field (Advantage on Stealth).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
